Argoverse 2 Attribution
=======================

This project replays scenarios from the Argoverse 2 Motion Forecasting Dataset:

  Wilson, B., Qi, W., Agarwal, T., Lambert, J., Singh, J., Khandelwal, S.,
  Pan, B., Kumar, R., Hartnett, A., Kaesemodel Pontes, J., Ramanan, D.,
  Carr, P., and Hays, J. "Argoverse 2: Next Generation Datasets for
  Self-Driving Perception and Forecasting." NeurIPS 2021 (Datasets and
  Benchmarks Track). https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.00493

Argoverse 2 is released under the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). It is licensed for
non-commercial use only; derivative works must be shared under the same
license. Any use of the dataset, including the subset downloaded by
scenarios/fetch_av2.py, must comply with those terms.

Scenario IDs are recorded in scenarios/manifest.txt for reproducibility. The
raw data itself is never committed to this repository.
